[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:73. The Way to King Street]
[00:00.340]Lesson 73. | 第73课。
[00:02.345]Last week, Mrs Mills went to London. | 上周，米尔斯夫人去了伦敦。
[00:06.685]She does not know London very well, | 她对伦敦不是很熟悉，
[00:09.790]and she lost her way. | 于是她迷路了。
[00:11.935]Suddenly, | 突然，
[00:13.525]she saw a man near a bus stop. | 她看到一个男人在一个公交车站附近。
[00:17.010]‘I can ask him the way,’ | “我可以问他路，”
[00:19.390]she said to herself. | 她自言自语道。
[00:21.760]‘Excuse me,’ she said. | “打扰一下，”她说。
[00:25.185]‘Can you tell me the way to King Street, please?’ | “请问您能告诉我到国王街的路怎么走吗？”
[00:29.425]The man smiled pleasantly. | 男人愉快地笑了笑。
[00:32.590]He did not understand English. | 他不懂英语。
[00:35.695]He spoke German. | 他说德语。
[00:37.465]He was a tourist. | 他是一名游客。
[00:39.605]Then he put his hand into his pocket | 然后他把手伸进口袋，
[00:43.110]and took out a phrase book. | 拿出了一本常用语手册。
[00:45.830]He opened the book and found a phrase. | 他打开书，找到了一句话。
[00:49.990]He read the phrase slowly. | 他慢慢地读着那句话。
[00:53.345]‘I am sorry,’ he said, | “对不起，”他说，
[00:56.150]‘I do not speak English.’ | “我不会说英语。”